WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.940
Humans!

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.730
If you wish not for
annihilation, take heed!

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.570
I bear a message from the depths!

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:20.710
You will surrender the surface
to us, the Clan of the Seafolk!

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:30.420
Thereafter you shall become
our nourishment, human scum—

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:37.600
Nice head! Are you related to
an octopus by any chance?

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:45.730
I heard it was that same guy again.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:47.570
What was his name?

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:50.650
I forget, but he's super-strong.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.540
HE TAKES EVERY OPPONENT OUT WITH A SINGLE PUNCH.

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.910
HE TAKES EVERY OPPONENT OUT WITH A SINGLE PUNCH.

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.910
BUT PEOPLE SAY HE STEALS OTHERS' CREDIT.

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.910
I MEAN, HE'S CLASS C.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:02.540
I MEAN, HE'S CLASS C.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.250
Class C?

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:07.000
Never seen him before.

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:10.090
I've got to keep up.

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:32.780
THE DEEP SEA KING

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:36.280
Help! Somebody!

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:41.160
We, the Clan of the Seafolk,
now rule the surface!

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:43.370
It is useless to resist!

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:49.170
You'll pay for that, human!

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.130
The Class A hero Stinger,

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:57.760
rising in popularity and currently
11th in the rankings, is here to help.

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.510
At your service, everyone!

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:00.760
It's Stinger!

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:01.810
We're saved!

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:03.020
Go for it!

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:05.770
Well now...

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:10.020
Anyone who needs a new blowhole
drilled into their torso, step right up!

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:23.910
One punch

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:29.370
Three, two, one, kill shot

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:33.130
sanjou, hisshou, shijou saikyou

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:33.130
He joins the fight, he wins, the strongest in history

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:35.130
nan datten da, frustration

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:35.130
Are you talking to him? Frustration ☹

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.630
ore wa tomaranai

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.630
He's not going to stop

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:40.760
one punch, kanryou, rensenrenshou

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:40.760
One punch, that's it, one fight after another

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:44.390
ore wa katsu, tsune ni katsu, asshou

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:44.390
He wins, he always wins, overwhelmingly

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:48.220
power, get power

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:48.220
Power, get power

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:51.190
girigiri genkai made

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:51.190
On to the very edge

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:52.400
Hero

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.560
ore o tataeru koe ya

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.560
There are voices praising him

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:58.610
kassai nante hoshiku wa nai sa

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:58.610
but he's not doing this for acclaim

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.860
Hero

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:04.620
dakara hitoshirezu aku to tatakau

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:04.620
So he just fight evil without end

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.080
Nobody knows who he is

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:10.250
sora ooi oshiyoseru teki

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:10.250
Enemies to fight are numerous as the stars

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:10.290
{OP Sync Point - Smiley Star, First Frame}

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.330
ore wa se wo muke wa shinai

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.330
and he's not gonna turn his back on you

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:14.670
Hero

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:19.670
naraba yuruginaki kakugo shita tame

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:19.670
He's made up his mind and ain't gonna yield

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:26.890
tatakau hero

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:26.890
A fighting hero

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:33.440
kodoku na hero

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:33.440
A lone hero

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:29.730
I

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:30.390
I

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.020
I

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:31.980
I

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:32.650
I

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:33.190
I

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:38.440
i wanna be a saikyou hero

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:38.440
I wanna be the strongest hero

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:45.370
Master...

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:48.040
You have moved up to
rank 2 in Class C.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.960
You are on the verge of
entering Class B!

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.080
Class B, huh?

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:56.590
That means I won't have any more
weekly hero quotas, right?

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.710
Correct.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.470
Oh, excuse me...

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:00.720
Hello?

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:02.680
City J? It is a bit far.

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:05.390
Are there no
competent heroes nearby?

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:06.850
Busy guy...

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:09.810
Master!

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:12.770
The monster you defeated
on your way home the other day

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:15.060
called itself one of
the “Seafolk,” right?

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:16.650
I forget.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:20.070
Several monsters calling themselves
the “Clan of the Seafolk”

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.780
have appeared in City J and
are attacking anyone in sight.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:28.290
A Class A hero fighting them
all alone and on the brink of defeat.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:33.040
His extreme fatigue
and pain are apparent

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:35.340
A prompt response from
the Hero Association

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.630
is desperately needed.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:37.880
Hang on!

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.180
The threat level is Tiger.

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:42.130
All citizens are asked to
stay out of the area.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:48.060
You've got spunk,
you slimy bastards.

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:50.980
My beloved Bamboo Shoot here

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:54.650
is happy to be battling enemies
with some grit for a change.

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:57.990
But it's time to end this.

00:04:57.990 --> 00:04:59.870
You can quit your boasting, human!

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:03.150
Your foolish fan club has run off.

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:05.870
But your death will not be easy.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:09.620
For the taking of our brothers' lives,
long will we cause you to suffer.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.200
Four fish to go!

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:16.250
It's a lot easier
without an audience!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.460
Sing, Bamboo Shoot!

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:25.840
Gigantic Drill Stinger
Quadruple Thrust!

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:29.180
I did it...

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.020
I did it!

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:34.560
These monsters were probably
a God-level threat...

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.190
and I defeated them all by my—

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:41.230
You know,
when something's so annoying,

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:43.190
it is a pleasure to watch it die.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:50.120
How much farther is City J?

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:51.910
We are almost there.

00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:53.540
But I am getting no readings.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:55.290
I will scout ahead.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.830
Once I have confirmed their
location, I will let you know.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:05:59.880
Oh...hey!

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:05.510
This is an announcement
from the Hero Association.

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:08.840
The threat level is Tiger.

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:13.060
All citizens, please stay clear of the area.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:15.670
CITY A - HERO ASSOCIATION HQ

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:15.680
Was the warning issued?

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.850
The request just went out.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:21.110
We'll need to update it and re-issue.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:22.900
What do you mean?

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.070
Stinger is down.

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:30.820
Mumen Rider here. I'm heading in.

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:32.330
Give me the location.

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:34.870
All lines are busy at this time—

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:37.830
- Where are they?
- Hey, best forget it!

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:40.880
Class C heroes
can't handle this one.

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:44.210
- Huh?
- The word just came down.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:47.130
Emergency evacuation warning.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:50.770
The threat level has been
raised from Tiger to Demon.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.760
All residents of City J,

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:52.760
- See what I mean?

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.270
please evacuate immediately.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:55.600
Hey!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:07:00.650
I repeat. All residents of City J,
please evacuate immediately.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:02.860
Evacuate?

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:04.480
How foolish.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.860
As if I'd allow even one
of these apes to escape.

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:14.040
So that's the one that got Stinger...

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:16.410
But he's the last of ‘em.

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:18.290
Should I wait for backup?

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:21.130
If it's one-on-one, maybe I can—

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:31.180
That smarts.

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:32.800
Why would you do this?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.220
Dammit, how'd he get behind me?

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:37.640
I was so surprised my voice
went all funky.

00:07:37.780 --> 00:07:40.690
Plus, my gunpowder-charged
lightning kick had zero effect!

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.730
I can't win.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.190
Who are you?

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:45.610
I am...

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:48.530
Lightning Max, the hero...

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:49.860
Fight me.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.960
Fight you? Of course.

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:53.070
I'll run for it as soon as—

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:59.460
What happened?

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:03.380
I can't feel my body...

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:10.590
Dammit.

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.510
You arrogant...

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:18.390
Lightning Flying Backwards
Roundhouse Kick!

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:37.910
Class S hero,

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:39.830
Puri-puri Prisoner.

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:43.670
I escaped from prison...
just to see you!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:45.000
Well, well.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:48.630
A hero serving time in prison?

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:53.220
I tagged along and
was able to escape too.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:54.760
My thanks.

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:58.970
Prisoner number 4188, Sonic, right?

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:01.060
Surprised I know?

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:03.690
You see, I check up on all
the boys who catch my eye.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:09.270
I'm serving a life sentence because
I can't resist attacking beautiful men.

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:10.900
Oh my.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:15.360
More soldiers come for me?

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:20.240
Goodness!

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:22.790
I feel the strength about
to erupt out of him!

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:24.580
Sonic, dear, you hang back.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:27.840
Class A rank 11, sweet Stinger.

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:30.840
Class A rank 20, Lighting Max.

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:33.510
I fancied them both.

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:36.930
And yet you ruined them!

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:40.680
Now that Genos has passed me,
I am the lowest in rank...

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.390
but I am still Class S!

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:44.310
I am unlike either of them.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:49.440
I'll begin at half-power,
to gauge how much you can take.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:01.870
You made me rip the hand-knit
sweater my boyfriend made!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:08.330
I will never, ever forgive you!

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:12.880
A delectable slab of meat, quite prime.

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:15.170
My appetite's up!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:23.680
Huh?

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:25.270
Oh my...

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.360
I felt that...

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.400
just a little.

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:39.490
I felt that too...a little.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:45.370
Puri-puri Prisoner is acting
tough, but he's hurting...

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.830
So this is what a fight between
a demon-level monster

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.580
and a Class S hero looks like?

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:52.380
It's almost comical.

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:55.470
Neither one could defeat me.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:59.510
Dammit... His punch was
stronger than I expected.

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:02.140
But I must not lose to him.

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:06.520
I can't have any more of my
boys destroyed by this monster...

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:08.190
I have no choice.

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:10.060
I'll have to transform.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:12.690
Ready...

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:14.650
Transform!

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:21.280
Puri-puri Prisoner Angel Style!

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:23.540
He's naked.

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:25.700
And he's definitely no angel.

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:27.790
Nor is he human.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.340
Nor do I want to watch.

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:30.210
I'm out.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:34.300
No one has ever seen my Angel
Style and lived to tell about it.

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:36.840
All the more reason to leave.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.840
Quite unsightly.

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:42.720
Are those...your last words?

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:52.480
Angel Rush!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:03.200
Elevated energy levels nearby.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:04.700
That must be it.

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:10.660
Damn it! I have no way
to reach Master!

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:12.370
It cannot be helped.

00:12:20.610 --> 00:12:23.930
Done with your combo?

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:29.930
I felt that...a little.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.190
Hear me.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:42.700
The objective of a combination
move is to finish your opponent.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:46.030
Each separate attack must be
delivered with intent to kill.

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:48.830
Like this.

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:58.750
Isn't this fun?

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:00.920
Just who are you?

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:03.260
I am the Deep Sea King.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:07.720
As lord of the Clan of the Seafolk,
this world is mine to rule.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:11.390
Do you dare defy me too?

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:15.600
You think you have the strength
to rule the surface all alone?

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:16.730
That's pathetic.

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:17.690
Oh?

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:20.650
Then I suppose you must die.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:21.860
That's my line.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:26.950
I would have let you live if you'd
shown me the respect I'm due.

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:30.740
I'm no hero, but I will eliminate you.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:34.120
The rain...is falling.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.130
Too slow.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:41.340
Wind Blade Leg!

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:46.180
Deep Sea King, I see
right through your moves.

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:49.720
Are you sure of that?

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.770
Once it bites, my little
moray here never lets go!

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:57.190
Let me be clear.

00:13:57.450 --> 00:13:59.730
There's no way I'd ever lose to you.

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:06.450
It's useless.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:07.990
You may have power...

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:15.040
but you're too slow to fight me.

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:17.750
I'm glad, Deep Sea King!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:22.630
Fighting something like you just
confirms how strong I really am!

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:26.760
You see, my moves are
the fastest and the strongest!

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:32.970
Now what, lost your mind?

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:37.770
He's faster!

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:41.360
Stronger too?!

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:44.230
What happened to him?

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:47.240
He's huge!

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:51.030
The air of the surface
shriveled me up a bit,

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:54.790
but thanks to this rain,
I feel like myself again.

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:58.790
Your attacks don't hurt me...
even a little!

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:14.430
At this time,

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:18.560
the whereabouts of the Seafolk
that attacked City J are unknown.

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:21.690
Several heroes who tried to stop them

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.270
have been found
unconscious at the scene

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.650
and remain in critical condition.

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:30.320
Of all the times to hit a red light...

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:33.490
Where'd he run off to?

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:36.790
Wait, you're...

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:38.830
Class C, rank 2.

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:40.630
You a hero too?

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:42.790
Have you seen Genos?

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.000
Genos?

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:49.090
Today, as our guest, we have
the top-ranked, Class A superhero

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:51.890
who has also been number
one in popularity rankings

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:53.640
for 28 weeks straight.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:56.930
He's also a successful
model, actor and singer.

00:15:56.930 --> 00:16:01.390
Let's welcome the
handsome Mr. Amai Mask!

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.020
Thank you for having me.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:09.780
We are currently facing
a threat level of Demon.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.740
How do you assess the situation?

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:14.320
That is a difficult question.

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:16.160
Why is that?

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:20.080
I'm only a hero when I confront evil.

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:23.880
The rest of the time, I'm
focused on my career as an artist.

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:25.380
I see.

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:29.010
I'm only here today
to promote my new song.

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:30.720
My apologies.

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:33.760
In that case, let's discuss your song.

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:37.720
Let me just say this.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:41.520
To assuage the public's
fears and worries,

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:44.900
heroes need to be
both tough and strong

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:51.490
so that they can defeat evil
with speed, grace, and brilliance.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:54.610
I find it regrettable
that there were heroes

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:57.160
who were completely
beaten by evil this time.

00:16:57.720 --> 00:17:01.040
So that no hero ever dies in vain,

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.960
I hope each will
continue to train his hardest.

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:07.500
My attacks have no effect.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:08.760
Could I be lacking in power?

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:11.260
I can't kill him unarmed.

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:14.010
I need to retreat for now
and find a weapon.

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:17.510
Caught you!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:21.020
Crack crack, snap snap.

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.190
Huh?

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:25.520
Wait there.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:30.440
The next time we meet
will be your demise.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:34.280
No matter.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.870
The small fry can be let go.

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:43.200
Who are you?

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:44.830
What are you doing here?

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:47.130
There were orders to evacuate.

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:49.170
A hero?

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:52.130
If you're after the Deep Sea King,
better forget it.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:53.380
Deep Sea King?

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:56.220
You heroes could all jump
him at once and still lose.

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:59.390
You're fine at playing make-believe,

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.140
but against true power
you don't stand a chance.

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:02.970
You can't protect a thing.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.810
Who was that pervert?

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:11.900
The Seafolk?!

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:14.280
I sense numerous
life signals nearby.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:16.200
With so many...

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.700
The evacuation shelter!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:25.080
Daddy, are the scary
monsters still outside?

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:29.670
Don't worry. As long as
we're in this shelter, we're safe.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.420
Besides...if it comes down to it,

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.710
I'm sure all of us together
can beat a monster or two.

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:39.090
I sense them...

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:41.350
Yes, so many!

00:18:42.110 --> 00:18:43.810
It's coming from...

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.930
over there!

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.650
Greetings...

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.900
and goodbye.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:00.740
Please wait!

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:03.200
We surrender!

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:06.250
We will comply with
any demands you have.

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:09.250
But please do not attack. I beg you.

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:13.960
I'm only Class C, so I
evacuated. Now I'm trapped.

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:16.760
I'm no hero. I'm a failure...

00:19:17.070 --> 00:19:18.380
Surrender?

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:23.850
I've come to kill you.
Your deaths are inevitable!

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:27.140
And as for my demands...

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:31.730
How about I demand you scream
nicely as I slaughter you?

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:33.400
I can't win...

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:34.980
I know it won't amount to much,

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:38.030
but all I can do is buy time for
the Class S heroes to get here.

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:40.490
But look at this monster...

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:42.410
Who am I kidding?

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:46.330
I can't buy time just
by talking to him.

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:49.330
I pissed my pants...

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:51.500
I'm pathetic.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.500
I'll fight with you!

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.750
Heroes?

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.510
There are others in here too?

00:19:58.020 --> 00:20:00.880
I may be the lowest ranking at 38,

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:03.640
but I'm still a Class A hero.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:04.760
We can do this.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.140
I-I'm a hero too!

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:09.190
Allback-man is here!

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:10.230
Heroes?

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.810
The heroes are here?

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:12.810
Heroes!

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:13.940
They'll save us!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.820
I feel better with a Class A around.

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:18.190
Yeah...

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:22.830
Two Class C's, one
Class B and one Class A...

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:23.990
We can do it!

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:25.240
We can win!

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:30.160
You sure this is the way?

00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:33.790
Yes, since residents are
fleeing from this direction,

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:35.500
we'll find monsters further up.

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:40.220
Did you see a butt
naked guy run past?

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:41.180
What?

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:43.380
Maybe he was taking a
bath and was left behind.

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:45.100
I'll check it out.

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:46.680
Go on without me.

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:47.850
Got it!

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:50.980
Mumen Rider here.

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:53.900
Yes, we're on our way.

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:56.020
What! The shelter?

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:58.650
It was the other way!

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:10.750
All right. When I give
the signal, charge him.

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:14.750
One...

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:17.460
Two...

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:21.590
That's weird.
I know I saw him...

00:21:33.700 --> 00:21:36.880
Why so quiet all of a sudden?

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:39.230
Are you one of the Seafolk?

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.780
Mumen Rider went in?

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:47.740
Yes. I couldn't stop—

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:49.120
Mumen Rider?!

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:50.540
What's your location?

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:52.540
This is beyond you.

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:55.040
The monster even took
out a Class S hero!

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:58.380
We need to assemble
a subjugation squad.

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:00.500
A Class S hero was defeated?

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:01.670
Who is this?

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:03.840
Where's Mumen Rider?

00:22:05.780 --> 00:22:07.840
Stand-up Peddling Mode!

00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:10.310
Roar, Justice!

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:13.470
Is this the Hero Association?

00:22:13.620 --> 00:22:15.730
Yes. Who are you?

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:18.560
Give me the owner of
that cell phone right now!

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:20.730
This is the hero Saitama.

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:22.650
Saitama?

